Project: ClassFlow — Teacher Workflow & Student Intervention System

Its core promise:

“At the end of every school day, a teacher should know exactly which students need attention and what work is still pending.”

MVP could be only:

Login
 ↓
My Classes
 ↓
Students
 ↓
Observations
 ↓
Homework
 ↓
Assessments
 ↓
Attention Queue
 ↓
Student Timeline
 ↓
PTM Summary

